      592        SIZE 14.63 BY .92 TOOLTIP "HAHA" NO-UNDO.
      593   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      594        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      595        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 54.88
      596        r-sale AT ROW 3.46 COL 39
      597        my-inkas AT ROW 3.5 COL 21.63 COLON-ALIGNED
      598        BUTTON-1 AT ROW 4.79 COL 1.75
      599        BUTTON-2 AT ROW 6.29 COL 1.75
      600        BUTTON-3 AT ROW 7.79 COL 1.75
      601        BUTTON-4 AT ROW 9.21 COL 1.75
      602        BUTTON-5 AT ROW 10.79 COL 1.75
      603        BUTTON-6 AT ROW 12.29 COL 1.75
      604        BUTTON-7 AT ROW 13.79 COL 1.75
      605        "testi7.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      606             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 13.79 COL 59.13
      607             FGCOLOR 4
      608        "testi3.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      609             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 7.79 COL 59.25
      610             FGCOLOR 4
      611        "testi2.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      612             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 6.29 COL 59.25
      613             FGCOLOR 4
      614        "testi1.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      615             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 4.79 COL 59.25
      616             FGCOLOR 4
      617        "testi5.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      618             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 10.79 COL 59
      619             FGCOLOR 4
      620        "testi6.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      621             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 12.21 COL 59.13
      622             FGCOLOR 4
      623        "testi4.txt" VIEW-AS TEXT
      624             SIZE 17.25 BY 1 AT ROW 9.21 COL 59
      625             FGCOLOR 4
      626        "Результаты ищите в файле:" VIEW-AS TEXT
      627             SIZE 25.25 BY 1 AT ROW 3.38 COL 51.63
      628             FGCOLOR 4
      629        SPACE(2.61) SKIP(10.65)
      630       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      631            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      632            TITLE "Тесты корректности отчета о продаже"
      633            CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
      634   ASSIGN
      635          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      636          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      637   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      638   DO:
      639     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
      640   END.
